  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Sarasota, FL\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Sarasota, FL\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nSarasota, FL\nSpecialty and 24/7 Emergency\n941.923.7260\n7414 South Tamiami Trail\nSarasota, FL 34231\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nBy appointment\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – serving greater Sarasota.\nWe are located in Sarasota, serving pets and their families in Bradenton, Venice, Sarasota, Osprey, Nokomis, Ellenton, Palmetto, Englewood and other communities in the Tampa Bay area and Southwest Florida.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our team is ready to provide expert care in case of a pet emergency. If your pet requires a veterinary specialist, we are ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nIn an emergency, call ahead and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary.\nLearn more about your emergency visit\n.\nSpecialty care\nOur veterinary specialists work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nLearn more about your specialty visit\n.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Sarasota.\nOur BluePearl animal hospital has three surgical suites and multiple exam rooms. It’s fully equipped for ultrasound, x-rays, endoscopy, oxygen therapy, cataract surgery and more. We are excited to be in the process of expanding our vet hospital, so we can better serve you.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n941.923.7260\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n941.923.7260\n941.927.9235\n7414 South Tamiami Trail\nSarasota,\nFL                                    34231\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nClearwater, FL\n4701 Ulmerton Rd., Ste. 500\nClearwater, FL 33762\n727.572.0132\n46.16 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nBrandon, FL\n607 Lumsden Professional Ct.\nBrandon, FL 33511\n813.571.3303\n48.67 miles\nBluePearl Pet Surgery\nTown ‘n’ Country\nTampa, FL\n7512 Paula Dr\nTampa, FL 33615\n813.901.5100\n52.07 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
